#: src/Form/CrawlerPage.php:162
msgid "Manual crawl"
msgstr "Crawl manual"

#: src/Form/CrawlerPage.php:166
msgid "Editoria11y reports populate and update in real time as editors work, so a manual crawl is generally only helpful when first installing the plugin or after making major theme or configuration changes."
msgstr "Laporan Editoria11y terisi dan diperbarui secara real-time saat editor bekerja, jadi crawl manual umumnya hanya berguna saat pertama kali memasang plugin atau setelah melakukan perubahan besar pada tema atau konfigurasi."

